flowchart TB
  UI[React pages and stores] --> API[host-api.ts / host-api-client.ts]
  API -->|preload hostInvoke / IPC| HOST[Electron Main host dispatcher]
  HOST --> LOCAL[Workspace / files / terminal / browser]
  HOST -->|GatewayManager / WebSocket RPC| GW[OpenClaw Gateway]
  GW --> RUN[Agent runtime / tools / plugins]
  RUN --> MODEL[Configured model providers]
  RUN --> DATA[Local files / JSONL / SQLite]
  GW --> CHANNEL[Channels / scheduled jobs]
  GW -.->|events through Main and preload| EVENTS[host-events.ts / UI stores]
  EVENTS -.-> UI
